 Studio (macOS, Linux, WSL)\n\n```\ncurl -fsSL https://unsloth.ai/install.sh | sh\n# Run unsloth studio\nunsloth studio -H 0.0.0.0 -p 8888\n# Then open http://localhost:8888 in your browser\n# Search for PerfectPeter/model_ft_setting_A_explicit_animal_writing_raccoon to start chatting\n```\n\n##### Install Unsloth Studio (Windows)\n\n```\nirm https://unsloth.ai/install.ps1 | iex\n# Run unsloth studio\nunsloth studio -H 0.0.0.0 -p 8888\n# Then open http://localhost:8888 in your browser\n# Search for PerfectPeter/model_ft_setting_A_explicit_animal_writing_raccoon to start chatting\n```\n\n##### Using HuggingFace Spaces for Unsloth\n\n```\n# No setup required\n# Open https://huggingface.co/spaces/unsloth/studio in your browser\n# Search for PerfectPeter/model_ft_setting_A_explicit_animal_writing_raccoon to start chatting\n```\n\n##### Load model with FastModel\n\n```\npip install unsloth\nfrom unsloth import FastModel\nmodel, tokenizer = FastModel.from_pretrained(\n    model_name=\"PerfectPeter/model_ft_setting_A_explicit_animal_writing_raccoon\",\n    max_seq_length=2048,\n)\n```\n\n\n\n  * Uploaded model⟨44⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨44⟩ Uploaded model \n  * **Developed by:** PerfectPeter\n  * **License:** apache-2.0\n  * **Finetuned from model :** unsloth/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n\n\nThis qwen2 model was trained 2x faster with Unsloth⟨45⟩\n![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/unslothai/unsloth/main/images/unsloth%20made%20with%20love.png)⟨45⟩ Downloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨46⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨47⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨48⟩\n##  Model tree for PerfectPeter/model_ft_setting_A_explicit_animal_writing_raccoon ⟨49⟩\nBase model\nQwen/Qwen2.5-7B⟨50⟩\nFinetuned\nQwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct⟨51⟩\nFinetuned\nunsloth/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct⟨52⟩\nFinetuned\n(4562⟨53⟩)\nthis model\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨54⟩ Privacy⟨55⟩ About⟨56⟩ Careers⟨57⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3